  "name": "zg_neutral",
  "about": "NBP base float: hip ~30, knee ~48, ankle pointed, toes 0, neck down ~13, shoulder flex ~45 / abd ~32, elbow ~70, fingers 40% curled, spine a little rounded. Breath 4 s, limb float 6 s, root drift 12 s.",
